# Quantumult X 域名优先分流规则；需已有“节点选择”策略
# 节点入口与明确的内网域名先直连
host, node.284021.xyz, direct
host, localhost, direct
host-suffix, local, direct
host-suffix, lan, direct
host-suffix, home.arpa, direct

